THIRD-PARTY NOTICES for ooxml-schema
====================================

The generated code in src/generated/ embeds names, summaries, content-model
data and enumeration values derived from the Open XML SDK schema data, and
attribute default values taken from the ECMA-376 Transitional XML Schemas.
See ADR-0002 (docs/adr/0002-schema-driven-code-generation.md) §1-§2.


1. Open XML SDK schema data
---------------------------

Source: https://github.com/dotnet/Open-XML-SDK, directory data/
(schemas/*.json, parts/*.json, namespaces.json), commit
431ab05cf160248cc3885a4a766026d4f8243792. Per-file SHA-256:
reference/openxml-sdk-data/PROVENANCE.md in the ooxml-rs repository.

