2. ECMA-376 Transitional XML Schemas
------------------------------------

Source: Ecma International, ECMA-376 Part 4, 5th edition (December 2016),
OfficeOpenXML-XMLSchema-Transitional.zip inside
https://ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-376-4_5th_edition_december_2016.zip
(SHA-256 bd25da1109f73762356596918bf5ff8b74a1331642dba5f1c1d1dfc6bed34ecd;
inner archive d34187520749998af306faf1b730e568b0ca6d88ad24638a407c0a9bb4ca04fc).
Only attribute default values are used (implementing the specification in
a conformant product, item (iv) below). The schemas themselves are vendored
unmodified in reference/ecma-376-transitional-xsd/ of the ooxml-rs
repository; per-file SHA-256 in its PROVENANCE.md.

